{
  "schema_version": "pdd.native-source-lint-followup.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/lint-before-tests-followup.md",
  "synthetic": true,
  "boundary": "src/runtime-client.mjs#runCheck",
  "notes": [
    "Native fixtures use actual Git-visible synthetic repositories and injected transport/capture observations.",
    "Generated oversized candidate uses valid scenario schema but is not read by whyNoTests.",
    "Cached busy is a definitive saved not-run note and remains exit 5/not_run. Refreshed busy is a transient GET HTTP 429 error server-full without a matching job receipt and retains ordinary read uncertainty: exit 3/unknown.",
    "Retry info is separate from warnings; exactly one public JSON result.",
    "Existing source-only-lint-cases.json and Runtime cases are unchanged.",
    "All fixture descriptors, case inputs and expected observation names are native harness metadata, not runtime wire fields, exported APIs or verdict-producing ports. Assertions must observe the real public boundary and effects; do not assert descriptor metadata itself."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "missing-schema",
      "criterion": "AC1",
      "input": {
        "files": {
          "product/plan.md": "# Plan",
          "tests/order.json": "{}"
        },
        "options": {
          "--lint": true
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "exit_code": 2,
        "capture_calls": 0,
        "auth_calls": 0,
        "posts": 0,
        "diagnostic_contains": [
          "tests/order.json",
          "is not a PDD test file"
        ]
      }
    },
